# cv_verify — bulk captured data, not source. Raw/enhanced training
# captures live on the Pi + local disk as working data; the actual
# versioned destination for annotated images is Roboflow, not git (kept
# out to avoid permanently bloating repo history — 400MB+ as of the first
# 100-image collection). scratch/ is throwaway debug captures from bring-up,
# never meant to be committed.
software/cv_verify/training_data/
software/cv_verify/scratch/

